      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name}: I disagree pretty hard with that. This button would be for people who understand the \"risk\" and do not care. It's intrinsically understood that if you go to a completely random world you are gonna find some crazy stuff. \nThe whole point of a random button is that I ***don't want to*** go to worlds from a curated list. I want to see something I haven't before, whatever that might be. If I as a user want to open myself up to chaos, I should be allowed to do so. \nOn that note, I'd like this button to have an option to include labs worlds, as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
